            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Less than most people expect. A typical folded treadmill still occupies the width of the machine and a few feet of depth, and stands tall against a wall. Unfolded, it needs the same space as any treadmill, including roughly 6 feet of clearance behind the deck.",
